# rcmaker Project Rules

Before implementation, read `AGENTS.md` and `.agents/skills/rcmaker-development/SKILL.md`. Load the task-specific references selected by the Skill and the corresponding `.agents/doc/` pages.

Reuse all applicable rcmaker components. Do not duplicate framework validation, data access, HTTP, response, cache, Session, Token, Queue, process or static application capabilities. Keep Windows development code compatible with configurable Linux multi-process production deployments.
